  AlertCircle, AlertTriangle, ArrowLeft, ArrowRight, Award, BookOpen, Brain, Calendar, CheckCircle2, CheckSquare, Clock, Compass, FileText, Flame, FolderUp, HelpCircle, Layers, LayoutDashboard, Lightbulb, Menu, MessageSquarePlus, Play, RefreshCw, Send, Settings, ShieldAlert, ShieldCheck, Sparkles, Target, TrendingUp, Upload, X, XCircle
